When your Life would be reduced by an opposing effect, by discarding this card from the Removed Zone, your Life won't be reduced.

Flash - {{Accel|Cost 4 ()}}
Return an opposing LV1/LV2 Spirit to the Hand. Then, (Once per Turn: Same Name) you can return a "Bannerace" family Spirit card from your Removed Zone to the Hand. After this effect resolves, put this card onto the Removed Zone.
